# Beside defect 421 (lane b14-harness-b, 2026-10-07): nothing here asks a type
# of `helper.ident`, so its letter is bound by nothing and the name is refused
# `cannot_infer` where it stands. On the compiler before defect 402's repair
# this checked clean and the build stopped at exit 2, *monomorphisation
# produced an ill-formed program*.
use helper

function main()
    _ = helper.ident  #~ cannot_infer
